WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.200
Say your boss at your summer job gives you

2
00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:03.780
a 4 percent raise.

3
00:00:03.780 --> 00:00:09.830
Nice. That same year, the
CPI goes from 250 to 260.

4
00:00:09.830 --> 00:00:12.300
That is 4 percent inflation.

5
00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:15.060
Your pay kept up with prices exactly.

6
00:00:15.060 --> 00:00:18.190
So if all pay rose as fast as prices,

7
00:00:18.190 --> 00:00:20.730
would inflation still hurt anyone?

8
00:00:20.730 --> 00:00:24.050
In this mission, you'll calculate
inflation rates and spot

9
00:00:24.050 --> 00:00:27.680
disinflation and deflation in CPI data.

10
00:00:27.680 --> 00:00:30.460
Then you'll compare
nominal and real values,

11
00:00:30.460 --> 00:00:33.530
and see why that
difference matters so much.

12
00:00:33.530 --> 00:00:35.660
Your mission: find out who,

13
00:00:35.660 --> 00:00:39.390
if anyone, still pays the
price when prices rise.
